OL,3,ACrashed RAF jet steered to 'avoid
OL,4,Abuilt-up areas' before pilots ejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn RAF jet was steered to "avoid
OL,7,Fbuilt-up areas" before two pilots
OL,8,Fejected out of the aircraft, an air
OL,9,Fforce commander has said.
OL,11,FGp Capt Gez Currie, Station Commander,
OL,12,Fsaid: "The aircraft would have been
OL,13,Faimed in a direction that the pilot
OL,14,Fbelieved was open field, in order to
OL,15,Favoid built-up areas and anybody on the
OL,16,Fground."
OL,18,FThe Hawk T2 aircraft had been flying
OL,19,Fout of the RAF Valley station on
OL,20,FAnglesey on Wednesday when it plummeted
OL,21,Fto the ground in nearby Pencarnisiog,
OL,22,Fnarrowly avoiding homes.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
