OL,3,AMan jailed for throwing bottle at
OL,4,Amigrant protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father-of-two has become the first
OL,7,Fman jailed following an anti-migrant
OL,8,Fprotest in Portsmouth after admitting
OL,9,Fthrowing a plastic bottle and swearing
OL,10,Fat police.
OL,12,FDel Somerville, 42, was given a
OL,13,Ftwo-year sentence after previously
OL,14,Fpleading guilty to violent disorder at
OL,15,Fthe city's crown court following the
OL,16,Fovernight protest near Eastney Marina
OL,17,Fon 6 September.
OL,19,FHundreds of protesters gathered after a
OL,20,Fboat carrying about 120 migrants was
OL,21,Fbrought ashore near Eastney Beach.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
