OL,3,A'It has broken us as a family,' mother
OL,4,Aof poison seller victim tells hearing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a British victim of
OL,7,Fpoison seller Kenneth Law has said his
OL,8,Fdeath and the way that he died had
OL,9,F"destroyed" their family.
OL,11,FTanya Whitaker broke down at the start
OL,12,Fof her video statement about the death
OL,13,Fof her son, Samuel, shown on the second
OL,14,Fday of a four-day sentencing hearing of
OL,15,FLaw in Ontario, saying: "He barely had
OL,16,Fa chance."
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
