OL,3,AFour civilians killed in Pakistani
OL,4,Astrikes in Afghanistan, Taliban says
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's the second wave of Pakistani air
OL,7,Fstrikes on Afghan territory in the past
OL,8,Fweek, and comes after a deadly attack
OL,9,Fon a police facility in Pakistan on 18
OL,10,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
